  "assumptions": "Sequential one-day fluxes in the listed code order, bounded by the available source pool; rates are designed teaching values, not natural kinetic constants. Input enters NH₄⁺. Fixation represents protected microbial sites; ambient oxygen switch controls nitrification/denitrification, not all nitrogenase regulation. No quantitative water-quality forecast, energy budget or instantaneous visible die-off."
